    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A hand modification that allows wizards to store spells on their fingers and cast them using aether fuel.</p>\n              <h3>Features:</h3>\n              <ul>\n                <li><strong>Capacity:</strong> 5 spells (one per finger)</li>\n                <li><strong>Spell Level:</strong> 1st level wizard spells only</li>\n                <li><strong>Imprint:</strong> Consume a wizard spell scroll to store it on a finger</li>\n                <li><strong>Cast:</strong> Use aether fuel to cast stored spells</li>\n                <li><strong>Upcast:</strong> Spend a spell slot to cast at 2nd level</li>\n              </ul>\n              <p class=\"elysium-info-box\"><strong>Note:</strong> This modification requires attunement and a minimum wizard level of 3. Different aether qualities may produce varying effects and risks.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
